 Visitors and Alumni - JMU Libraries","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Available to all visitors during the host library’s operating hours; no library card is required. Check current library locations and hours before going.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"jmu-counseling-center-oasis-reset","subject_type":"activity","entity_name":"The Oasis","title":"Take a Quiet Reset in the Oasis","subtitle":"A free student relaxation space in the Counseling Center","notes":"Bring your JACard, check in at the Counseling Center front desk, and share a quiet decompression break while respecting the room’s restorative purpose.","short_summary":"Pause together between classes in a student self-care room equipped with relaxation resources.","evidence_claim":"JMU’s Counseling Center says the Oasis is free for students to use after checking in with a JACard and notes that it includes massage chairs.","source_url":"https://www.jmu.edu/news/counselingctr/2023/04-august_17_fall_semester_wellness_resources.shtml","source_title":"Counseling Center: Campus Wellness Resources - JMU","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":"2026-04-09","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Current JMU students only. Check in with a JACard at the Counseling Center front desk in Student Success Center, third floor, Suite 3100.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"jmu-counseling-center-studio-create","subject_type":"activity","entity_name":"The Studio","title":"Make Art Together in the Studio","subtitle":"Free student art supplies for a casual creative break","notes":"Check in with your JACard, pick a simple project everyone can try, and return shared supplies neatly when your low-pressure art session ends.","short_summary":"Gather for an informal creative session using the Counseling Center’s provided art materials.","evidence_claim":"JMU’s Counseling Center states that the Studio supplies art materials and is free for students to use after checking in with a JACard.","source_url":"https://www.jmu.edu/news/counselingctr/2023/04-august_17_fall_semester_wellness_resources.shtml","source_title":"Counseling Center: Campus Wellness Resources - JMU","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":"2026-04-09","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Current JMU students only. Check in with a JACard at the Counseling Center front desk in Student Success Center, third floor, Suite 3100.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"jmu-university-park-pickup-game","subject_type":"activity","entity_name":"University Park","title":"Start a Pick-Up Game at University Park","subtitle":"Student courts, fields, and equipment without an extra fee","notes":"Swipe in with your JACard, choose pickleball, tennis, basketball, or another available activity, and check out shared equipment if your group needs it.","short_summary":"Turn an open court or field into a spontaneous game using equipment included for eligible members.","evidence_claim":"JMU says students have UREC membership, may play pick-up sports at University Park during operating hours, and can check out equipment at no extra cost.","source_url":"https://www.jmu.edu/recreation/visit/guide.shtml","source_title":"University Recreation (UREC) Guide - JMU","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":"2026-05-14","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Current JMU students and other eligible UREC members must swipe a JACard or use the UREC app. Facility access and equipment checkout are included; verify operating hours.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
